REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_PEPE PepE alpha-aspartyl dipeptidase recycling path after PepE
# Continuum ...->daca->dacb->dacc->dacd->amph->mlta->mltb->mltc->mltd->mlte->emta->mpl->ldca->mpaa->ycjg->pepd->pepn->pepq->pepp->pepa->pepb->pepe->pepe
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow.

ENTITY gate OF Cell 1 40 0
ENTITY poor OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY dead OF Cell 0 20 0
ENTITY twin OF Cell 1 30 0
ENTITY ceil OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY g0 OF Cell 1 24 0
ENTITY starved OF Cell 1 36 0
ENTITY printer OF Cell 1 48 0

